ntrast than frame 64.","The face is 5 ink rows in a slot whose original lettering uses 6.","Uppercase only: the source face has no lowercase, so MISS replaces the catalog Miss.","The original hand-placed counter-shadow pixels are not reproduced."],"reviewer":"agent","schema":"tokimemo.battle-miss-agent-review.v1","ticket":"T-39010"}
